 \n GPG key ID: B5690EEEBB952194 \n \n \n Verified\n \n \n Learn about vigilant mode .\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n Security \n Kyverno v1.19.2 addresses 24 published GitHub Security Advisories: 9 Critical, 14 High, and 1 Moderate. The fixes include: \n \n Cherry-pick workflow script-injection hardening (Critical): GHSA-5gq8-3xxc-jm92 ( #18014 ). \n API path validation and namespace confinement (Critical): GHSA-3xfv-vq8x-qhg4 , GHSA-pcx2-xcq4-65vf , GHSA-4pqm-wqq6-h9q2 , GHSA-p58h-r4j3-h5vx , and GHSA-rcxg-3f92-3mgr ( #17984 , #18021 ). \n NamespacedMutatingPolicy target confinement (Critical and High): GHSA-jcw5-3wcg-fqx5 , GHSA-f96w-622v-rqpq , and GHSA-vm98-8c25-h274 ( #17984 , #18021 ). \n PolicyException enforcement in generated admission policies (High): GHSA-qc9c-3fgf-cgq8 ( #17987 ). \n CEL evaluation cost limits (Moderate): GHSA-m8p2-qqmx-j53x ( #17989 ). \n Bounded wildcard matching, safer variable substitution, and panic prevention (High): GHSA-8mrj-27wr-599g , GHSA-338x-hgrv-626h , GHSA-r2p2-3892-5jjf , and GHSA-x4xq-p8g4-6fwg ( #17991 ). \n Image verification and attestation hardening (Critical and High): GHSA-h3pm-q9ww-f439 , GHSA-fcfr-fr8g-qjqv , GHSA-24cc-9745-hxfc , GHSA-2r43-6962-xcw5 , GHSA-3f2c-hfj8-542w , and GHSA-fr24-3hvf-393q ( #17994 , #17996 ). \n Generate authorization, clone namespace confinement, and internal-label protections (High): GHSA-q62c-r9v2-cf64 , GHSA-hg5v-hwm3-956r , and GHSA-493q-9xvg-9xf3 ( #17937 , #17938 ). \n \n See the linked advisories for affected-version details. Upgrade to v1.19.2 to receive these fixes. \n What's Changed \n \n feat: Add filter field to imageExtractors for wildcard array filtering by @arewm in #16269 \n perf: reduce engine context checkpoint copy cost by @ANAMASGARD in #17565 \n ci: record failed job instances in workflow failure issues (Cherry-pick #16889 ) by @kyverno-pr-updater[bot] in #17587 \n perf(cel): build the request activation once per admission request (Cherry-pick #17572 ) by @kyverno-pr-updater[bot] in #17588 \n test(ci): CEL admission-path allocation-regression gate (post-merge) (Cherry-pick #17573 ) by @kyverno-pr-updater[bot] in #17589 \n fix(deleting): process namespaced resources with pagination (Cherry-pick #17263 ) by @kyverno-pr-updater[bot] in #17603 \n fix(webhook): avoid image validating policy webhook name collisions (Cherry-pick #17558 ) by @kyverno-pr-updater[bot] in #17617 \n fix: autogen fine-grained namespaced image policies (Cherry-pick #16840 ) by @kyverno-pr-updater[bot] in #17614 \n chore(deps): bump kyverno sdk version to the latest commit (Cherry-pick #17616 ) by @kyverno-pr-updater[bot] in #17619 \n fix(cli): resolve match constraints for namespaced validating policies (cherry-pick #17608 ) by @harshrajdebug in #17612 \n fix(webhook): enforce exceptionNamespace for CEL PolicyExceptions (Cherry-pick #17479 ) by @kyverno-pr-updater[bot] in #17651 \n fix: preserve MutatingPolicy reinvocation policy (Cherry-pick #17324 ) by @kyverno-pr-updater[bot] in #17745 \n feat(charts): support Pod user namespaces in PSS policies (Cherry-pick #17693 ) by @kyverno-pr-updater[bot] in #17746 \n fix(cli): preserve GeneratingPolicy skips in test results (Cherry-pick #17388 ) by @kyverno-pr-updater[bot] in #17749 \n fix(background): resolve generate triggers by name instead of listing the namespace (Cherry-pick #17702 ) by @kmehta-code in #17779 \n fix(mpol): evaluate matchConditions during background mutateExisting evaluation (Cherry-pick #17433 ) by @kyverno-pr-updater[bot] in #17782 \n fix: verify annotations properly for cosign v2 and v3 (Cherry-pick #17794 ) by @kyverno-pr-updater[bot] in #17798 \n feat: support additionalExtensions for keyless signing in the ivpol (Cherry-pick #17813 ) by @kyverno-pr-updater[bot] in #17814 \n test(cli): cover CRD-aware policy test mapping (Cherry-pick #17808 ) by @kyverno-pr-updater[bot] in #17816 \n perf(cel): hoist the request-map build in the ivpol engine (Cherry-pick #17585 ) by @raunak-nirmata in #17872 \n [release-1.19] fix(deps): bump go to 1.26.9 to fix CVE-2026-97031 by @rx18-eng in #17976 \n fix(imageverify): bound the reads image verification makes from a registry by @raunak-nirmata in #17996 \n fix(engine): bound wildcard matching and variable substitution by @raunak-nirmata in #17991 \n fix(imageverify): verify at admission instead of trusting prior-stage metadata by @raunak-nirmata in #17994 \n [1.19] fix(security): API path validation, apiCall canonicalization, mpol/cleanup namespace confinement by @Rohanraj123 in #17984 \n [1.19] fix(security): harden cherry-pick workflows against script injection by @JimBugwadia in #18014 \n fix(vap): apply the runtime PolicyException gates in the admission-policy generator by @raunak-nirmata in #17987 \n fix(cel): bound the cost of CEL policy expression evaluation by @raunak-nirmata in #17989 \n fix(security): cherry-pick N4K #1077 and #1164 (namespace clamp) to release-1.19 by @Rohanraj123 in #18021 \n fix: preserve controller-owned generation labels ( #17938 ) by @aerosouund in #18033 \n fix(pss): support user namespace pods in validate.podSecurity by @Suhani95 in #17913 \n [release-1.19] fix(deps): update x/net for CVE-2026-97032 by @Sashang-debug in #18027 \n [release-1.19] fix(deps): update x/net for CVE-2026-78663 by @Sashang-debug in #18025 \n fix: repair the post-merge Tests workflow on main ( #17761 ) by @aerosouund in #18035 \n test: expect the generation label protection webhook in chainsaw asserts by @aerosouund in #18039 \n [release-1.19] fix: preserve legacy generation scope and ownership by @sagark-nirmata in #17937 \n chore: pass GORELEASER_CURRENT_TAG to the goreleaser by @aerosouund in #18124 \n chore: bump chart to 3.9.2-rc.5 for v1.19.2-rc.5 by @aerosouund in #18132 \n chore: bump chart to 3.9.2 for v1.19.2 by @aerosouund in #18145 \n \n New Contributors \n \n @arewm made their first contribution in #16269 \n \n Full Changelog : v1.19.1...v1.19.2 \n \n \n Contributors \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 