  "text": "\n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n Unvalidated Stack Pointer at the ESP-TEE Privilege-Switch Boundary · Advisory · espressif/esp-idf · GitHub \n\n\n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n Skip to content \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n Navigation Menu Sign in Products Platform GitHub Repository hosting, code review, and collaboration Copilot AI coding agent for tasks, projects and automated work Build & Ship Actions CI/CD and automation Code Quality Quality analysis, fixes, and enforcement Codespaces Cloud development environments Secure Code Security Vulnerability detection and remediation Secret Protection Secret scanning and leak prevention All Features Developers Learn Documentation Training Certifications Build Build with Copilot Customize Copilot Integrations Explore Trending repos GitHub Sponsors Developer articles Changelog Changelog Your source for the latest features, improvements, and fixes across GitHub products, all in one place. Businesses By Stage Enterprises Team Startups Nonprofits By Industry Healthcare Financial services Manufacturing Government See all industries Evaluate GitHub Why GitHub Customer Stories Business insights Trust Center Add-ons GitHub Advanced Security Enterprise-grade code security Copilot for business Enterprise-grade AI features Premium Support Enterprise-grade 24/7 support Resources Learn & Connect Documentation Resource center Blog Events & webinars Community Forum Customer Stor